                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 1.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Telegram of February 18, 1904.</hi></head>
                <p>Last night a company of Korean soldiers attacked electric carriage, property of
                    American citizens, damaging it and injuring operator. American seamen quieted
                    the disturbances.</p>
